msgid ""
"The PX4FMU (\"PX4\") is end of life and is not generally available for "
"purchase - ditto this companion board! This article is made available for "
"existing users."
msgstr "PX4FMU（「PX4」）已停产，通常无法购买——本配套板亦如此！本文仅供现有用户参考。"

