"The PX4-IO board Contains its own on board microcontroller and stacks with "
"the PX4-FMU board."
msgstr "PX4-IO 板内置独立微控制器，可与 PX4-FMU 板叠加安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:16
